### Health check, as AgentCore Runtime calls it
GET http://localhost:8080/ping

### Trigger Budget Analyst agent, as AgentCore Runtime calls it
### The whole body is the task. The session ID comes from this header, which
### AgentCore sets.
POST http://localhost:8080/invocations
Content-Type: application/json
X-Amzn-Bedrock-AgentCore-Runtime-Session-Id: local-session-0123456789abcdef0123

{
    "task": "Calculate the budget for a corporate event with venue, catering, and entertainment"
}
